  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "callingcards",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tCalling Cards\n\t\n\nThis is data produced in both the Brent Lab and Mitra Lab at Washington University.\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tAccessing Data\n\t\n\nThe examples below require\nlabretriever\n(pip install labretriever) and/or the\nHuggingFace Hub client\n(pip install huggingface_hub).\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tAccessing Data with labretriever\n\t\n\nThis repository is part of a collection configured as a unified database using\nlabretriever.VirtualDB.\nDownload the\ncollection config\nand use it to query the data directly in\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/BrentLab/callingcards.",
  "alternateName": [
    "BrentLab/callingcards",
    "Calling Cards Transcription Factor Binding Dataset"
  ],
  "creator": {
    "@type": "Organization",
    "name": "Michael Brent's Lab at WashU",
    "url": "https://huggingface.co/BrentLab"
  },
